  by: agent  # b36a
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b36a
  clock: 3  # b36a
  nonce: b36a  # b36a
  message: "Demoted to P3: this META extends provenance capability (adds derivation chains, multi-source attribution, declared pass dependencies) rather than correcting an active contract violation. The behavior map functionally works today; we just can't query its derivation graph or credit multi-pass evidence. P3 reflects 'important enhancement, not urgent fix' — distinct from the P2 METAs (INV-rugok / INV-dajaf / INV-tolaj / INV-manov) which each address an active drift/dishonesty/miscount."  # b36a
